    "Our Story": "Our Story",
    "KAAFI HOSPITALS is a private healthcare facility located in Bosaso, Bari region, Somalia. Established in February 2019, its primary objective is to advance healthcare services in Puntland and across the country. Since its inception, the hospital has positioned itself as one of the leading private medical centers in Bosaso, delivering a diverse range of healthcare services to the local community. Its strategic location—on the main road, opposite Shabeele Hotel—makes it easily accessible, allowing patients from all parts of the city and the region to reach the facility with ease.": "KAAFI HOSPITALS is a private healthcare facility located in Bosaso, Bari region, Somalia. Established in February 2019, its primary objective is to advance healthcare services in Puntland and across the country. Since its inception, the hospital has positioned itself as one of the leading private medical centers in Bosaso, delivering a diverse range of healthcare services to the local community. Its strategic location—on the main road, opposite Shabeele Hotel—makes it easily accessible, allowing patients from all parts of the city and the region to reach the facility with ease.",
